    {
      "id": "claim_1b667a045a8744c4895694c53565dd04",
      "statement": "`getAdminToken()` in `frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/keycloak.ts` mints the Keycloak Admin API token by POSTing `grant_type=client_credentials` with `keycloakServiceClientId`/`keycloakServiceClientSecret` to the realm's `/protocol/openid-connect/token` endpoint, and maps any non-OK token response to an `AuthError` with code `KEYCLOAK_UNAVAILABLE` and HTTP status 503 rather than a 401.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/keycloak.ts#L67-L93",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0a8072a82522660a4a2b3aeb2f1d96dbe6e2e806180ddf6b61e0b3435268e6ce:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8d54d6a504f04bcb965c6b87d9d068eb",
      "statement": "The BFF service-account credentials (`keycloakServiceClientId` from `KEYCLOAK_SERVICE_CLIENT_ID`, default `mcm-bff-service`, plus its secret) are separate from the user-facing app client credentials (`keycloakClientId` from `KEYCLOAK_CLIENT_ID`, default `movie-collection-manager`, plus `KEYCLOAK_CLIENT_SECRET`), which are used for the `authorization_code` and `refresh_token` grants.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/keycloak.ts#L101-L165",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:50f65fe71454fc9911844e814673bf5ce53fc5aa594fbdebc6bc28ee3f34ce7e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/config/env.ts#L36-L42",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b2a0abf0af31095408cb791f3244a2d3d357477b3a9c5afd556c8ff53d4793c1:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_219718c1f2704c5d9a90affed09b5363",
      "statement": "`email-service.ts` carries its own duplicated `getAdminToken()` implementation (comment: duplicated from keycloak.ts to avoid circular deps) instead of importing the one in `keycloak.ts`, so a change to the admin-token grant, endpoint, or error handling must be applied to both copies.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/src/bff-server/email-service.ts#L11-L35",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:71d786e4f386b20e2a3d3ce50b9166e0e1eeabe7cac43ef898005d1b2f9d75e1:"
        }
