    {
      "id": "claim_3f273190dff1441993b1363126ee5695",
      "statement": "`keycloakAdminApiBase` is derived from the internal `keycloakUrl` (runtime env) rather than a build-inlined public origin, so Admin API calls (user creation, role assignment, SSO logout, email verification) reach Keycloak from inside a container.",
